    "collapsible_content_FJbMyE": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_content_HxkixQ": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "1. Can I take this with other supplements or medications?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "custom_icon": "shopify://shop_images/help_80dp_000000_FILL0_wght400_GRAD0_opsz48.png",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. Haritaki is a whole-food herb, not a synthetic compound. That said, if you're on prescription meds, check with your doctor first.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "collapsible_row_content_mkRYwm": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "2. Is this vegan?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "custom_icon": "shopify://shop_images/help_80dp_000000_FILL0_wght400_GRAD0_opsz48.png",
            "row_content": "<p>100%. Vegan, non-GMO, gluten-free. Just pure Terminalia chebula, nothing artificial, no fillers.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "collapsible_row_content_nzKp3p": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "3. Can this help with vivid dreams or deeper sleep?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "custom_icon": "shopify://shop_images/help_80dp_000000_FILL0_wght400_GRAD0_opsz48.png",
            "row_content": "<p>Many users wake up remembering dreams they'd normally forget. Better pineal function = better melatonin = deeper, more restorative sleep.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "collapsible_row_content_ygj7dt": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "4. What does Haritaki actually do in the body?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "custom_icon": "shopify://shop_images/help_80dp_000000_FILL0_wght400_GRAD0_opsz48.png",
            "row_content": "<p>The \"King of Medicines\" in Ayurveda. Supports gut health, mental clarity, and natural detox, used by healers for 5,000+ years.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "collapsible_row_content_dbPH3h": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "5. Is this safe to use long-term?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "custom_icon": "shopify://shop_images/help_80dp_000000_FILL0_wght400_GRAD0_opsz48.png",
            "row_content": "<p>It's been used daily for 5,000 years. Third-party tested, zero known toxicity at recommended doses.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "collapsible_row_content_CJggzh": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "6. How is this different from Haritaki powder?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "custom_icon": "shopify://shop_images/help_80dp_000000_FILL0_wght400_GRAD0_opsz48.png",
            "row_content": "<p>Powder tastes terrible and oxidizes quickly. Capsules = consistent dose, no bitter taste, stays potent longer.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "collapsible_row_content_w8FGcP": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "7. Can I take it if I'm sensitive to detox effects?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "custom_icon": "shopify://shop_images/help_80dp_000000_FILL0_wght400_GRAD0_opsz48.png",
            "row_content": "<p>Start with 1 capsule per day and build up. Haritaki is gentle, but everyone's body is different. Listen to yours.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "collapsible_row_content_9QiiGF": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "8. Do I need to change my diet while using it?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "custom_icon": "shopify://shop_images/help_80dp_000000_FILL0_wght400_GRAD0_opsz48.png",
            "row_content": "<p>No major changes are needed. Haritaki works with your current lifestyle. That said, cleaner eating = faster results. But it's not required.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "collapsible_row_content_7HAdFr": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "9. Will this help clear mental fog or improve focus?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "custom_icon": "shopify://shop_images/help_80dp_000000_FILL0_wght400_GRAD0_opsz48.png",
            "row_content": "<p>When your gut is clogged, so is your brain. Haritaki clears the pathway. Users report sharper focus and clearer thinking within weeks.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "collapsible_row_content_yiRwcV": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "10. How long until I see results?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "custom_icon": "shopify://shop_images/help_80dp_000000_FILL0_wght400_GRAD0_opsz48.png",
            "row_content": "<p>Most users report vivid dreams returning within 7 days. Mental clarity improvements often noticed within 2-3 weeks of consistent use.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "collapsible_row_content_Q8rffz": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "11. Where is the haritaki sourced?",
